      "id": "hackernews-2026-07-13-logseq-2-0-beta-db-version-is-here",
      "title": "Logseq 2.0 Beta (DB version) is here",
      "summary": "Article URL: https://github.com/logseq/logseq/releases\nComments URL: https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=48896229\nPoints: 41\n# Comments: 16",
      "body": "Desktop APP 2.0.1 (Beta Testing)\nLogseq 2.0 Beta (DB version) is here! 🎉\nAfter a long wait, our first Logseq 2.0 beta release is finally here. We know many of you have been looking forward to trying it, and we’re excited to put it in your hands!\nThis is an early beta, so you may encounter some rough edges. We’d love for you to give it a try and tell us what works, what doesn’t, and what you’d like to see next. Your feedback will help us improve Logseq and shape the stable release.\nBefore getting started, please take a moment to read these updates:\nBig update: Logseq is splitting into two versions\nAs with any beta, please back up your important data before testing. You can share feedback and report issues through our GitHub issue tracker.\nThank you for your patience, encouragement, and continued support. We’re excited to begin this next chapter with you! ❤️\nDesktop app Nightly Release 20260710\nThis is a nightly release of the Logseq desktop app.\nIt's unstable compared to the official releases, use it with caution!\nDesktop/Android APP 0.10.15 (Beta Testing)\nBeta 0.10.15 [[Dec 1st, 2025]]\nDesktop app and Android App download link: https://github.com/logseq/logseq/releases/tag/0.10.15\nFix: Youtube embeds not working\nDesktop/Android APP 0.10.14 (Beta Testing)\nBump pdf.js to 4.2.67, thanks to https://github.com/Th-o-mas\nSecurity vulnerability (GHSA-92h5-2358-7xjv) with remote code execution has been closed.\nfix: match paste of x.com links for twitter #12043\nDesktop/Android APP 0.10.13 (Beta Testing)\nFix: Youtube embeds not working #12031\nDesktop/Android APP 0.10.12 (Beta Testing)\nBeta 0.10.12 [[May 26th, 2025]]\nDesktop app and Android App download link: https://github.com/logseq/logseq/releases/tag/0.10.12\nApp freeze, high CPU/GPU usage, and frequent diff prompts #11880\nUsing GTK 2/3 and GTK 4 in the same process is not supported #11873\nDesktop/Android APP 0.10.11 (Beta Testing)\nIncludes all changes from Beta 0.10.10 [[May 7th, 2025]] and fixes major regressions with it.\nImages and themes not working #11486\nGlobal search in blocks not working #11851\nNOTE: You may need to run the command Rebuild search index for this fix.\nDrag and drop of pdfs not working #11850\nDesktop/Android APP 0.10.9 (Beta Testing)\nUpdate Italian translation in #11179\nAdd Linux ARM64 build support in #11183\nFix e2e-test command in #11217\nFix missing refs for property text values when creating a page #11208\nFix incorrect behavior of the delete key for deleting the last char #11190\nFix missing default colors for highlight mark tag #11247\nNew block placeholder should accept tab and enter key #11255\nRestore App window at current workspace #11246\nI18n: Italian #11179, Slovak #11226\nLinux ARM64 build support #11183\nDesktop/Android APP 0.10.8 (Beta Testing)\nUpdate Italian translation in #11154\nFix shift+mouse click on PDF View not invoking area highlight on Linux in #10973\nFix missing newline after multiline block when exporting a page in #10934\nFix toggling of task list in #11079\nUpdate Simplified Chinese) translation in #11119\nUpdate Turkish translation in #11063\nRemove obsolete \"@tailwindcss/line-clamp\" dependency in #11130\nFix toggling of task list #11079\nMissing newline after multiline block when exporting a page #10934\nIncorrect cursor move for the emoji from the line head #11112\nShift+mouse click on PDF View not invoking area highlight on Linux #10973\nFine tune page title search strategy #11147\nLogout and clear keys for Logseq Sync #11111\nFix ui button component's click handling #11068\nI18n: Simplified Chinese #11119, Turkish #11063, Italian #11154\nDesktop/Android APP 0.10.7 (Beta Testing)\nAdd partial Persian translation in #10938\nFix :graph/current usage in the electron state in #11013\nFix typo in mldoc package name in #10995\nFix preserve root node block refs when cutting + pasting in #10841\nAdd new keybinding for \"toggle expand/collapse this block\" in #10980\nFix main scrollbar jumps in #10037\nAdd .heic to media type #11017\nPreserve root node block refs when cutting + pasting. #10841\nFix main scrollbar jumps #10037\nFix wrong :command/toggle-favorite handling in config #10998\nFix search term query highlight performance #11030\nNew keybinding for \"toggle expand/collapse this block\" #10980\nAdd share/open asset file for Android App #10977\nEnhance accent color related details #10986\nrefactoring dropdown/context menu with the new components #10897\nBetter handling for macOS scrollbar system setting of auto scrolling mode #11048\n@punchagan made their first contribution in #10995\n@topherhunt made their first contribution in #10980\n@YU000jp made their first contribution in #10037\n@farcaller made their first contribution in #11013\n@tdomhan made their first contribution in #10841",
