      "author": "brainlessdev",
      "publishedAt": "2026-07-11T17:24:15.000Z",
      "imageUrl": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/57/Earendel_and_the_Sunrise_Arc_in_the_galaxy_cluster_WHL0137-08_%28sunrisearc2%29.jpg/1280px-Earendel_and_the_Sunrise_Arc_in_the_galaxy_cluster_WHL0137-08_%28sunrisearc2%29.jpg",
