      "id": "theverge-2026-07-06-hoto-8217-s-pixeldrive-screwdriver-is-down-to-60-matching-it",
      "title": "Hoto&#8217;s PixelDrive screwdriver is down to $60, matching its best price",
      "summary": "If your Prime Day purchases included a new desk, TV stand, bookshelf, or other furniture you still haven’t assembled, Hoto’s PixelDrive cordless screwdriver can help speed up the process. It’s currently on sale for $59.99 ($20 off) at Amazon, matching its best price to date. \nHoto PixelDrive Cordless Screwdriver\nHoto’s latest electric screwdriver delivers an adjustable 6Nm of torque, along with a ",
      "body": "If your Prime Day purchases included a new desk, TV stand, bookshelf, or other furniture you still haven’t assembled, Hoto’s PixelDrive cordless screwdriver can help speed up the process. It’s currently on sale for $59.99 ($20 off) at Amazon, matching its best price to date.&nbsp;\n[Product: Hoto PixelDrive Cordless Screwdriver | https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0FKBJL68H?tag=theverge02-20, https://hototools.sjv.io/c/482924/1601240/18215?u=https%3A%2F%2Fhototools.com%2Fproducts%2Fhoto-pixeldrive-cordless-screwdriver%2F]\nFrom tightening loose screws on furniture to repairing electronics, the PixelDrive is designed to handle a wide range of household projects. Hoto includes 30 screwdriver bits that cover many of the most common screw types, all neatly organized in a small cylindrical case. It also offers six adjustable torque settings, allowing you to use less power when working with fragile electronics or increase it when putting together a desk, bookshelf, TV stand, or other furniture. You can also switch between a slower 80RPM mode for more precise work and a faster 200RPM mode with the press of a button.\nHoto also added several features that make assembling projects a little easier. A built-in display lets you quickly check your current torque setting and remaining battery life, while an integrated LED light helps illuminate dim spaces, whether you’re working under a desk or inside a cabinet. The rechargeable 2,000mAh battery also charges over USB-C, so you won’t need to keep buying disposable batteries.",
      "source": "The Verge",
      "category": "tech",
      "tags": [
        "Deals",
        "Gadgets",
        "Tech",
        "Verge Shopping"
      ],
      "author": "Sheena Vasani",
      "publishedAt": "2026-07-06T20:24:28.000Z",
      "imageUrl": "https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/10/hoto1.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0,10.677911339888,100,78.644177320224",
